        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: मर्यादा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मर्यादा — maryādā — \"a limit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रत्येक गोष्टीला एक मर्यादा असते. pratyek goṣṭīlā ek maryādā aste. Everything has a limit."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मर्यादा (maryādā) घालणे, to set a limit; मर्यादा (maryādā) ओलांडणे, to overstep it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मर्यादा (maryādā) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit maryādā, \"region, boundary\" (CDIAL 9895)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
