              "text": "शिथिल करणे — śithil karṇe — \"to relax (a rule)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पाऊस थांबल्यावर प्रशासनाने निर्बंध शिथिल केले. pāūs thāmbalyāvar praśāsnāne nirbandh śithil kele. When the rain stopped, the administration relaxed the restrictions."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने नियम शिथिल केला, tyāne niyam śithil kelā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिथिल, slack, loose; शिथिल होणे, to slacken."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिथिल करणे (śithil karṇe) joins the tatsama शिथिल, Sanskrit śithila, \"loose, slack\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to make\"."
            }
